        </mxCell>

        <!-- Lab test plan -->
        <mxCell id="test-plan" value="LAB TEST PLAN:&#xa;&#xa;1. Create table in Aurora (ledger_entries)&#xa;2. Create DMS source endpoint (Aurora)&#xa;3. Create DMS target endpoint (Kafka)&#xa;4. Create DMS task (CDC mode)&#xa;5. Insert 10K rows → measure CDCLatencyTarget&#xa;6. Insert 1M rows in single transaction&#xa;   → observe latency spike (reproduce client issue)&#xa;7. Tune ParallelApplyBufferSize → compare&#xa;8. Check CloudWatch: NetworkTransmitThroughput" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
